---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Terms of Use · Week Without Driving Las Vegas';
const description = 'Terms for using lvwwd.org and its trip planning tools.';
---

<BaseLayout {title} {description}>
  <section class="container-page page-top reading">
    <h1 class="page-title">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Last updated September 29, 2026</p>

    <article class="prose-doc mt-8">
      <p>
        Las Vegans for Better Transit (LVBT) runs lvwwd.org for Week Without Driving Las Vegas. You
        can use its public guides, bus finder, and Bingo without signing up. Signing up and
        submitting entries requires a connection.
      </p>

      <h2>What you send us</h2>
      <p>
        Use your own contact details and describe trips you actually took. Do not send another
        person's private information, unlawful or abusive material, or a photo or post you do not
        have the right to share. Do not try to bypass sign-up or entry limits. LVBT may remove
        material that breaks these terms or the <a href="/giveaway/rules">Official Rules</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Adding a post or screenshot is optional. LVBT will not publish an entry's post or screenshot
        unless you check its sharing box or give permission separately. The <a href="/privacy"
          >Privacy page</a
        > explains what we keep and when it is deleted.
      </p>

      <h2>Trip information</h2>
      <p>
        RTC routes, fares, and schedules can change. Check the <a
          href="https://www.rtcsnv.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">RTC website</a
        > before traveling. LVBT cannot guarantee that a listed trip, stop, or service will be available
        when you go.
      </p>

      <h2>The giveaway</h2>
      <p>
        The <a href="/giveaway/rules">Official Rules</a> cover eligibility, entries, the prize, and the
        draw. They control if they differ from these site terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>
        Email <a href="mailto:wwd@lasvegasfortransit.org">wwd@lasvegasfortransit.org</a>. Nevada law
        governs these terms.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
